Prosper Loans Story
The Prosper Loans Story presents an in-depth exploration of the historical trends in loan listings on the Prosper platform, analyzing the performance and status of these loans over time. This narrative highlights the significant impact of external factors, such as the mortgage crisis of 2008, on the volume of listings recorded, revealing a steep decline that persisted until mid-2011. Through detailed visualizations, the story examines loan classifications, borrower demographics, and credit performance metrics, ultimately shedding light on the factors that influence loan outcomes and the correlation between borrower characteristics and loan performance.
